<p>The share card is a 1200×675 picture of an outfit: the render, each item, its price and the total.</p>
<h2>Make one</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Open an outfit in the inspector.</li>
  <li>Choose <strong>More → Save as image</strong> (or <strong>Copy image</strong>).</li>
</ol>
<h2>Where it’s drawn</h2>
<p>On your device, on a canvas, from data already loaded. Nothing is uploaded and no link to a hosted image is created.</p>
<h2>Be considerate</h2>
<p>An outfit belongs to the player who saved it. Share your own freely; for someone else’s, think about whether they’d mind.</p>
